# The seeded fixtures exist to test `.env` KEY-NAME detection inside a full
# integration run, so their env files have to be committed. The root .gitignore
# excludes `**/.env` and `**/.env.local`; re-include them here, and here only.
#
# Every value in these files is an obvious placeholder. The wizard's detector
# reads key names and never values, so a placeholder detects exactly like a
# real secret. Never commit a real credential to this tree.
!.env
!.env.local
!**/.env
!**/.env.local
